  "agent_notes": [
    "Normal TLS verification failed with the exact managed-proxy error 'self signed certificate in certificate chain'; public GET requests were retried with curl --insecure only after confirming the expected NIRF and official university hostnames.",
    "All four supplied NIRF government-directory pages contain the assigned institution as Swami Vivekanand Subharti University, Meerut, Uttar Pradesh.",
    "The official site confirms the Meerut campus identity and address. Its central catalogue pages are current but not reconciled: the undergraduate page has an empty law section, the diploma page repeats Diploma in Medical Laboratory Science, and linked faculty tables expose additional or differently named programmes and conflicting programme-family granularity.",
    "Because the official site claims more than 220/250 programmes but provides no single reconciled master catalogue, the complete active catalogue cannot be established without guessing about duplicates, omissions, and current status. Courses were therefore not imported and the record remains manual_review."
  ]
